    "attributes": {
        "action": "Lifetime animal ownership ban for animal killers & mandatory custodial sentence",
        "additional_details": "We want this to be known as \u2018Minnie\u2019s Law\u2019.",
        "background": "We call for a lifetime ban on owning animals for anyone who has killed an animal, and for offenders of such crimes to be automatically given a custodial sentence which must be served in full.",
